OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FApart from
OL,6,Fthe odd shower this evening will be
OL,7,Fdry. Then the rest of the night will
OL,8,Fbe dry across all parts with lengthy
OL,9,Fclear periods.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FIt will be a dry day
OL,12,Feverywhere with some good spells of
OL,13,Fsunshine. Light winds.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWindy
OL,16,Fon Tuesday with some patchy rain
OL,17,Flater. Early rain on Wednesday then
OL,18,Fmainly dry and bright. Bright with the
OL,19,Fodd shower on Thursday.
